1
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:40,030
It hurts, doesn't it?

2
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:42,380
You'll feel better tomorrow, Betty, believe me.

3
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:47,140
Only one day, and it won't hurt as much.

4
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:48,140
Do you feel like eating?

5
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,680
Having some dinner?

6
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,680
Oh, don't look so sad.

7
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:55,440
Let me tell you about your dinner.

8
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:57,150
It's ice cream.

9
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:58,460
Ice cream.

10
00:00:58,460 --> 00:01:00,440
All kinds of flavors.

11
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:03,130
Chocolate.

12
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:04,800
Strawberry?

13
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:05,930
Vanilla?

14
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:08,000
Vanilla, too?

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,850
I see you're feeling better already, Betty.

16
00:01:09,850 --> 00:01:12,110
So you will have dinner?

17
00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:14,230
OK, honey, we'll see to it

18
00:01:14,230 --> 00:01:18,430
that you have strawberry and vanilla ice cream.

19
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:19,550
Just rest now.

20
00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:27,570
You need some rest to help you get better quickly.

21
00:01:27,570 --> 00:01:30,900
Hi, Frank.

22
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:34,600
How you doing?

23
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,600
Oh, come on now.

24
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,750
You're a big boy.

25
00:01:36,750 --> 00:01:40,550
It doesn't hurt that much, does it?

26
00:01:40,550 --> 00:01:43,160
Oh, I'm sorry it hurts so much,

27
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,830
and you won't be able to have dinner.

28
00:01:44,830 --> 00:01:48,660
You're just going to have to have ice cream.

29
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:51,160
Yes, ice cream.

30
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,580
Lots of flavors.

31
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:54,230
Want to hear them?

32
00:01:54,230 --> 00:01:56,380
Chocolate?

33
00:01:56,380 --> 00:01:57,870
Then chocolate it is.

34
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:59,330
One scoop or two?

35
00:01:59,330 --> 00:02:01,550
Three scoops?

36
00:02:01,550 --> 00:02:11,230
Then three it will be.

37
00:02:11,230 --> 00:02:13,180
You want three scoops also?

38
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:15,900
Chocolate, too?

39
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:18,620
Well, I see you're feeling better.

40
00:02:18,620 --> 00:02:22,680
Well, at least you're acting like you feel better.

41
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:32,940
Three scoops of chocolate ice cream for Tim coming up.

42
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:35,330
Hi, Carl.

43
00:02:35,330 --> 00:02:39,180
How you doing?

44
00:02:39,180 --> 00:02:41,320
I know it hurts.

45
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:43,570
But it'll be better tomorrow.

46
00:02:43,570 --> 00:02:45,810
In the meantime, what would you like?

47
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:48,280
Surprise.

48
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,820
A surprise?

49
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:53,120
I promised you a surprise, didn't I?

50
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:57,100
And it wasn't just ice cream, was it?

51
00:02:57,100 --> 00:03:00,130
Your birthday is tomorrow, isn't it?

52
00:03:00,130 --> 00:03:02,730
Well, maybe, just maybe,

53
00:03:02,730 --> 00:03:04,540
there will be a surprise.

54
00:03:04,540 --> 00:03:07,860
But first you have to smile.

55
00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:13,580
I just want to see one smile from you.

56
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:18,170
No smile, no surprise.

57
00:03:18,170 --> 00:03:19,780
That's the deal.

58
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:21,660
No smile, no surprise.

59
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:23,100
If you want a surprise,

60
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:44,450
then you've got to smile first.

61
00:03:44,450 --> 00:03:47,060
How you all doing ?

62
00:03:47,060 --> 00:03:48,590
Well, I'm glad you're feeling better

63
00:03:48,590 --> 00:03:50,860
because we have a little surprise for you today.

64
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:52,430
It's Carl's birthday,

65
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:55,990
and we have Popo the Clown to entertain you.

66
00:03:55,990 --> 00:05:24,760
And here he is--Popo the Clown.

67
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:26,370
Happy birthday, Carl.

68
00:05:26,370 --> 00:05:28,060
Happy birthday.

69
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:29,240
All right, everybody.

70
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,130
OK, Carl.

71
00:05:30,130 --> 00:05:31,750
It's your birthday.

72
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:32,920
What 's your wish?

73
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,450
What would you like?

74
00:05:34,450 --> 00:05:36,820
Hmm?

75
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:39,820
You want to play charades?
